  </div>
  <button type="button" class="mo-sg__head" data-action="suggest-close">
    <span class="mo-sg__brand">
      <span class="mo-sg__ico" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="mo-sg__title">추천레이어</span>
    </span>
    <span class="mo-sg__right">
      <span class="count" data-bind="mo-sg-count">5</span>
      <span class="mo-sg__chev" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </span>
  </button>
  <div class="mo-sg__chips" role="tablist" aria-label="추천 주제">
    <button type="button" class="mo-sg__chip is-on" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-action="suggest-chip" data-suggest="어촌">어촌</button>
    <button type="button" class="mo-sg__chip" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-action="suggest-chip" data-suggest="해양산업">해양산업</button>
    <button type="button" class="mo-sg__chip" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-action="suggest-chip" data-suggest="해양환경">해양환경</button>
    <button type="button" class="mo-sg__chip" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-action="suggest-chip" data-suggest="해사안전">해사안전</button>
    <button type="button" class="mo-sg__chip" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-action="suggest-chip" data-suggest="항만">항만</button>
  </div>
  <div class="mo-sg__body">
    <p class="mo-sg__hint">주제를 선택하면 추천 레이어를 바로 켤 수 있습니다.</p>
    <ul class="mo-sg__list" data-sg-panel="어촌">
